\DOC SPEC1_TAC

\TYPE {SPEC1_TAC : term -> tactic}

\SYNOPSIS
Generalises a free variable of the goal's conclusion, adding it as a new
outermost universal quantifier.

\DESCRIBE
The single argument is a {term}: a variable {t} occurring free in the goal's
conclusion, which becomes the new outermost bound variable.
{
   A ?- u
   ================  SPEC1_TAC `t`
   A ?- !t. u
}
\noindent If {u} already begins with universal quantifiers {!x1 ... xn.} (with
n possibly zero), the new binder is placed outermost, before them.

\COMMENTS
In all observed traces, only this one transformation occurs.

\ENDDOC
